{
    "title": "Honey Jar - Voice Chat & Party",
    "description": "Connect with like-minded individuals on Honey Jar. Enjoy group voice chat, real-time interaction, a vibrant community that makes every moment enjoyable.\r\n\r\nWith Honey Jar you can:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Share your life and join chat room of theirs. Enjoy real-time broadcasting and connect with global users.\r\n\u2022 Connect with individuals from diverse backgrounds. Expand your social network and discover new cultures.\r\n\u2022 Participate in live events, challenges, and activities that keep you entertained and engaged.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll love Honey Jar:\r\n\r\nVOICE CHAT ROOM\r\n\u2022 Follow your favourite chat rooms and be the first to join the topic when they started.\r\n\u2022 Discover New Horizons! Always uncover fresh and exciting content with our wide array of hosts and topics. Every interaction is meaningful and memorable.\r\n\r\nLUXURIOUS DESIGNED GIFTS\r\n\u2022 Honey Jar brings you more options with stunning animated designed gift to express your feelings each other. You can have eye-catching entrance effects when you enter a chat room. Sleek design!\r\n\u2022 Gifts and Rewards! Support your favorite hosts with gifts and get rewards.\r\n\r\nCUSTOMER SUPPORT\r\n\u2022 Honey Jar provides dedicated customer service support, if you face any problem in the app, you can send a feedback, your problem will be resolved as soon as possible.\r\n\u2022 We do not tolerate any kind of inappropriate behaviours and respect our community guidelines.\r\n\r\nHoney Jar is FREE to download and explore. To experience more fancy features, you could check out our service of Nobility and VIP. Or purchasing Honey Coins to send gifts to have more fun!\r\n\r\n\r\nFor questions, please contact our team at feedback@honeyjar.live\r\nTo work with Honey Jar (Agencies/Business Partners), please mail to business@honeyjar.live",
    "descriptionHTML": "Connect with like-minded individuals on Honey Jar. Enjoy group voice chat, real-time interaction, a vibrant community that makes every moment enjoyable.<br><br>With Honey Jar you can:<br><br>\u2022 Share your life and join chat room of theirs. Enjoy real-time broadcasting and connect with global users.<br>\u2022 Connect with individuals from diverse backgrounds. Expand your social network and discover new cultures.<br>\u2022 Participate in live events, challenges, and activities that keep you entertained and engaged.<br><br>Why You&#39;ll love Honey Jar:<br><br>VOICE CHAT ROOM<br>\u2022 Follow your favourite chat rooms and be the first to join the topic when they started.<br>\u2022 Discover New Horizons! Always uncover fresh and exciting content with our wide array of hosts and topics. Every interaction is meaningful and memorable.<br><br>LUXURIOUS DESIGNED GIFTS<br>\u2022 Honey Jar brings you more options with stunning animated designed gift to express your feelings each other. You can have eye-catching entrance effects when you enter a chat room. Sleek design!<br>\u2022 Gifts and Rewards! Support your favorite hosts with gifts and get rewards.<br><br>CUSTOMER SUPPORT<br>\u2022 Honey Jar provides dedicated customer service support, if you face any problem in the app, you can send a feedback, your problem will be resolved as soon as possible.<br>\u2022 We do not tolerate any kind of inappropriate behaviours and respect our community guidelines.<br><br>Honey Jar is FREE to download and explore. To experience more fancy features, you could check out our service of Nobility and VIP. Or purchasing Honey Coins to send gifts to have more fun!<br><br><br>For questions, please contact our team at feedback@honeyjar.live<br>To work with Honey Jar (Agencies/Business Partners), please mail to business@honeyjar.live",
